    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into a ruined world, eaten away by time and haunted by echoes of a forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashborn is a 3rd-person 3D roguelite inspired by the Souls games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a demanding combat system, loot weapons and armour, and battle relentless enemies in a loop of death and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise, brutal combat: every blow counts, every mistake pays off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and mini-bosses: battle cursed creatures with a variety of patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark atmosphere: forgotten ruins, dying light...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic loot: find weapons and armour with every attempt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the curse. Fall. Rise again. Start again.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into a ruined world, eaten away by time and haunted by echoes of a forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashborn is a 3rd-person 3D roguelite inspired by the Souls games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a demanding combat system, loot weapons and armour, and battle relentless enemies in a loop of death and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise, brutal combat: every blow counts, every mistake pays off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and mini-bosses: battle cursed creatures with a variety of patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark atmosphere: forgotten ruins, dying light...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic loot: find weapons and armour with every attempt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the curse. Fall. Rise again. Start again.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A demanding roguelite Souls-like in 3rd person view. Dodge, hit, die and start again in a dark and broken world.",
